WEBVTT

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:34.070
The following tale is a work of pure fiction.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.800
Brother, 'tis General Hashiba whom we shall serve.

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:44.610
Though General Akechi be refined in warfare, he remains a rebel!

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:47.210
'Twould be ill-advised to serve a rebel!

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:52.440
Ye who stress wisdom would dare not serve one so unwise as to rebel!

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:58.820
Were ye to serve him, ye shall die a death worthy of a true warrior, regardless!

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:02.650
 June 06, 1582 {ts}

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:02.650
 Harima Province Himeji Castle {ts}

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:09.830
Sasuke!

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:20.340
I've traveled swift upon my steed through many a turmoil to inform ye of my brother's decision.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:25.470
And, shall I have General Nakagawa's allegiance?

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:31.860
Once ye march on Kyoto, Brother swears to ride swift with his forces.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.860
Very well! {yo yo}

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:41.390
Ye both have my gratitude! {yo iuttekureta}

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:44.160
General...

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.120
Faith in ye I had, Sasuke!

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:53.150
I knew ye to sway your brother without fail!

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:58.000
Servants, be quick with a feast for my fellow! {nani wo shiteoru, hayo gochisou yoi se}

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:01.640
 White Castle Blues {ts}

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:05.250
Sasuke, I confess to ye. {nasakenai hanashi daga}

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:11.390
'Twas rendered feeble upon learning of Milord's passing.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.970
I left the Mori's for Hidenaga to deal, {until makesete}

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:18.690
and I alone returned here to Himeji Castle to grieve.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.750
Know now the meaning of so swift a return.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.740
Only ye and I may know of this.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:27.720
I shall lose face were others to learn of my grief.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:30.800
How shall ye proceed?

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:35.710
General Akechi has occupied Akechi Castle and resumes rule in place of Milord.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:44.930
His failure to attain the head of Milord shall be his undoing. {until itate yo}

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.930
Without it, the generals he sought out shan't be committed to his rule.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:58.150
Generals Ikeda, Takayama, Niwa, Lord Oda Nobutaka

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:00.950
and the territories surrounding Kyoto have sought to ally themselves to me instead.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:08.230
Hidenaga and I have arranged to regroup at Amagasaki Castle.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:12.460
We are to engage Akechi's forces before General Shibata does.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:15.760
Emerge victorious, and I shall assume lordship of the realm.

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:17.740
And on that eve, Sasuke...

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:24.470
your dream of becoming a lord shall be realized.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.090
Be ye of truth? {hontou ni}

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:47.200
Sasuke, the true struggle for my lordship shall be soon.

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:52.580
I ask of ye and your brother to assist me.

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:57.970
I may become a lord... {until daidaimyou}

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:05.630
over province and castle?! {until aruji}

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:09.230
 June 07, 1582 {ts}

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:09.230
 Mikawa Province Okazaki Castle {ts}

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:10.500
Milord!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:14.100
General Akechi addresses a gift to Milord.

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:20.110
'Tis the Hatsuhana tea jar, a fabled masterpiece.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:25.110
"Henceforth, General Tokugawa shall reign absolute over the East.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:29.620
Additionally, I ask of ye allegiance to my reign."

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.950
Milord, be not deceived by this rebel!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:35.950
Though Milord and company returned to Mikawa without incident,

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:42.130
General Anayama Baisetsu traveled another path and was assassinated. {until yoshi}

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:46.080
We know not if he was murdered by the order of Akechi.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.610
Indeed.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:50.660
Perhaps General Akechi seeks to lure us with so lucrative of terms, {until obikiyose}

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.660
only to behead us upon arrival.

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.640
Behold the filthy jar he gifts to Milord!

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:01.010
He dares to proclaim so revolting a jar to be a masterpiece!

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.430
'Tis not meant for tea powder, but phlegm!

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.450
This damned jar be the source of hesitation!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.830
Be shattered to pieces!

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:16.430
Stay your hand, General!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.750
Shatter not the true Hatsuhana tea jar!

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:28.300
Though beheld the Hatsuhana tea jar I've not, {until keshiki}

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:35.720
rumors tell of this refreshing hue of autumn and petit beauty. {from uwasa until onaji}

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.350
The mere gifting of the Hatsuhana tea jar would imply {until akechidono wa}

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:44.250
that Milord retains the absolute trust of General Akechi.

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:54.150
I shall heed the words of the merchant, Chaya Shiroujirou of Kyoto.

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:55.490
Milord...

00:06:55.490 --> 00:07:00.050
Even the Hosokawas stay their hand from Akechi!

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.750
Know this, I do.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:05.710
I shan't be ignorant of my mens' counsel.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:10.510
However, fogged does the path to justice remain. {until mada hayai}

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:15.010
Begin conscriptions while we await this fog to lift.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:16.020
Aye.

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:19.200
Know ye, men, {until ieyasu}

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:25.090
that we extend no hand to any who stray the path of absolute justice.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.980
 June 08, 1582 {ts}

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.980
 Omi Province Azuchi Castle {tS}

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:33.970
Hidemitsu, you are to oversee the defenses of Azuchi Castle.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:34.790
Aye!

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:39.680
Once I return from paying tributes to the Gods and the Imperial Court,

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.390
we shall march on the Settsu and Kawachi provinces.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:48.170
Had they only offered allegiance, war shan't waged unto them.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.360
Though we continue to send for men of valor, {until orimasuga}

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:54.580
not Hosokawa, not Tsutsui, but none have come.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:08:00.680
Though the Imperial Prince acknowledges Milord's reign, none come forth.

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:06.550
Be of patience, Hidemitsu.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.520
The realm shan't be mend by haste.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:21.020
My fellow generals Hosokawa and Tsutsui... {until tsutsui dono}

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:26.180
Were we one, the realm would know of my magnanimity.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:28.410
I am no man of ambition.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:31.680
Yearn for naught but the pacification of the realm and its people.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:34.200
Why do ye fail to share my yearning?

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.230
Milord departs for Daitoku Temple?

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:47.770
Ye be a paragon of morality.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.740
Master...

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:06.250
mayn't ye convince General Akechi to spare the flame unto the masterpieces of Azuchi Castle?

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:09.500
A greeting was the intention of this day.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:16.510
Master, relinquish not the memory of the many masterpieces lost by Akechi at Honno Temple!

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:33.610
Should such masterpieces be lost to flame once more, tea brewery shall lose all meaning!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.280
Obsess not over such trifle. {until sore wa sore}

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.530
Moreover...

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:41.240
precedence lies with our own fates.

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.920
'T-Tis...

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.650
white!

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:55.740
The tiles even! {kawara made}

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:59.620
The black that was Azuchi Castle glistens profoundly of white!

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:07.180
'Twas the doing of General Akechi...

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:10.440
Doubtless am I of such marvel. {kore wa kore de migoto}

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:18.950
Woe, for the naivety of General Akechi.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:29.260
Though 'twas by my word that Azuchi Castle glistened black...

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:32.360
General Akechi had done the unthinkable.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:36.260
I, who hail "black" as supreme, {until watakushi ni}

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:39.840
was left speechless by the beauty of "white."

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:49.850
I've pondered naught but of aesthetics as of late.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:11:01.940
"White" be the aesthetic beauty of General Akechi...

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:07.230
 June 09, 1582 {ts}

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:07.230
 Saigoku Highway {ts}

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:16.330
Listen, Sasuke.

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:23.720
Retain ye my absolute trust, but is your brother's allegiance sole of mine?

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.300
What mean ye, General?

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:29.640
Our force of 5,000 shall reach Amagasaki Castle by morn.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:36.150
Disheartened I would be, were we to find ourselves isolated and without aid.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.780
Trust my brother as ye do myself.

00:11:39.220 --> 00:11:43.660
He and I desire the defeat of the rebellious Akechi Mitsuhide. {until katamatte orimasu}

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:48.160
Persuade him to send a hostage, mayn't ye?

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:54.630
Such a request would be certain to agitate him...

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:58.580
'Tis naught but a means to ascertain his loyalty. {until kakunin yo}

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.130
Think not of ill-will.

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:07.830
Were a warrior of your brother's standing to entrust a hostage to my care, {until dashita to nareba}

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:13.650
others would know that I am one worth serving.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:15.620
H-However...

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:19.200
Quell your concerns, for any of his kin shall suffice. {until hitojichi wa}

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:23.150
Be it his parents or children, I care not.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:29.660
I gift ye these socks, so do ride ahead to your brother.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:35.280
Perhaps a belonging shall suit well with Brother moreso a hostage...

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:36.670
You fool! {ahosuke ga}

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:42.660
Does your own father not live so leisurely under my care?!

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:47.430
Stay your fears, for I shan't wrong your brother's kin!

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:02.950
It shall be done then, General.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.370
All is well now.

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:14.170
Were Hidenaga to be delayed to Amagasaki Castle, {until okureyou to mo}

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:18.100
the aid of other generals shall increase my forces by several thousands.

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:22.890
Once gathered, we shall march to Oyamazaki and clash with Akechi's forces. {until mukau nomi}

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:29.830
None shall anticipate our swift return from Takamatsu Castle.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:42.250
Mitsuhide, ye be a man of morality.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:52.380
Ye sought to end the wrongs that Milord inflict upon the realm and its people.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:58.780
'Tis due to such morality that none shall serve ye.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:05.590
Men be of greed, and serve those whom they may seek benefit. {until senu mono da}

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:10.970
And men who have naught to gain shall be wise of your intentions.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:15.600
One so devoted to peace shall see more conflict from those who seek benefit.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:28.590
The visage of this natural beauty entices me moreso than that of masterpieces...

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.360
Curses.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.730
Devotion to war over beauty.

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:41.480
As the dream of ascending to lord draws nigh, {until kate ni}

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.570
I shall prevail against the wars to be fought! {from tenka until norikoerunoda}

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:49.280
 June 10, 1582 {ts}

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:49.280
 Settsu Province Amagasaki Castle {ts}

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:56.250
I ask of ye to bide, Brother.

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:58.660
Should you offer your son,

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:04.150
General Hashiba's forces shall be strengthened by such resolve for the war to come.

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:14.270
H-

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:17.790
Hairless Hideyoshi!

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:24.290
As per General Hashiba's request,

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:31.300
his loyal vassal comes to entrust a hostage, my son!

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:44.900
General Nakagawa, I know ye commit well to avenging Milord.

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:49.840
Though I requested of ye a hostage for fear of disheartenment, {until iutta ga}

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:54.450
Generals Takayama and Ikeda have sworn allegiance to me.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:57.520
Ye have my gratitude for such stout loyalty. {until jubun de gozaru}

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:00.110
Meaning...?

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:02.460
I need not a hostage.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:07.240
Though I took to tonsure as to display loyalty to avenging Milord, {until hodo daga}

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.670
General Nakagawa's loyalty surpasses my own.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:19.680
Generals, the loyalty of ye must rival that of General Nakagawa's.

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:24.190
Loyalty of mine <i>does</i> rival his!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:28.970
Was it not by the doing of Ikeda Tsuneoki that Amagasaki Castle {until shita koto}

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:31.190
may serve as the main camp to defeat Akechi?!

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:36.870
Was it not Takayama Ukon who sworn allegiance to ye first? {until kakusou watashi}

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:45.210
Upon the defeat of Akechi, I request ye to assist the spread the teachings of Christ.

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.650
Ye have my word.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:53.730
The day when the sound of organs reverberate throughout the realm draws nigh.

00:16:53.730 --> 00:16:54.930
Milord.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:17:01.730
A monk by the name of Araki Doufun requests an audience.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:03.830
Araki...?

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.230
I shall see to him.

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:10.190
Sasuke, brew our guest some tea.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.050
Aye.

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:23.110
I-Is this man not...

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:24.680
Araki Murashige?!

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:34.330
I've no knowledge of your identity, {until mekiki}

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:38.180
but the blade and appraisal imply ye an aesthete.

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:43.930
A castle may be raised with that bowl.

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:49.440
Spare me, and ye may have it.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:55.590
Rode from Bingo with haste upon receiving your letter.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:58.620
Brought with ye my request?

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:07.020
The letter from the Grand General, Ashikaga Yoshiaki, who was also sheltered in Bingo by the Moris.

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:13.460
The Grand General supports your expedition against Akechi.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:19.310
He prays that ye would govern well, once victorious.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:23.770
Though the Ashikagas be reduced by Milord to a mere puppet sovereign,

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:28.780
'tis all and well to be acknowledged by the Grand General as the General of the Realm.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:33.180
I have a request of ye as well, General.

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:43.680
'Tis the Momojiri copper flower vase.

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:48.860
I request an pardon and my life in exchange.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:58.190
No longer am I the rebellious cretin that was Araki Murashige.

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:05.020
Worn by nature and dried under the sun, I am alike the feces on a trodden path.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:22.170
Henceforth, I am your lord.

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.670
Sasuke, we return to the generals.

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:36.840
Ye be the aesthete who spared me, aye?

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.010
Behold, the visage of a survivor.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:48.750
Though suffer a great many ridicule and humiliation since we last met, {until sageyou ga}

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:52.400
overcome these hardships and survived I have.

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:57.900
Survive, and ye shall see fair days.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:08.300
General Hashiba shall succeed where Nobunaga had failed.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.300
We have the authority of the Grand General to wage war.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:20.980
Akechi shall soon learn of my coming.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:25.110
Inform him we shall of our presence in Settsu,

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.430
and he shall be left in disarray.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.610
Have ye readied the banners?

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.220
Sasuke!

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:37.030
Hear ye not a word I utter?

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:41.810
The charm of masterpieces indeed be a formidable foe to resist.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:52.460
These be banners be quite large, Brother.

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:55.920
I estimate them to be around four meters in length.

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:59.840
There be a banner to each force. {until oose degozaru}

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.600
Though, I have yet to determine a proper symbol.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:09.830
Ukon, know ye any emblems which display a heart in Barbarous art?

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:12.480
A heart...?

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:13.930
Aye.

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:18.480
I desire a symbol of gaud fashion, for be it in the memory of Milord.

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:25.300
I shall return in a moment.

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:40.630
'Tis a illustration of Portugal that I shan't part from.

00:21:44.630 --> 00:21:49.290
'Tis indeed a piece most brimming and vivid of hues.

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:54.250
Feel, I do, the dammed spring of my being overflowing of yearn.

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:57.250
What holds he to the chest?

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.190
A heart, Brother.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:09.350
Perhaps, salvation lies in the center of every heart, as does Christ.

00:22:10.810 --> 00:22:12.660
Aye, Brother?

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:24.670
Aye, for my heart be kindled by a flame akin to this illustration as well.

00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:34.650
Behold!

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:36.990
Under the flag of Milord's name, shall we exact vengeance!

00:24:33.700 --> 00:24:35.350
 What be of that symbol!? {ts}

00:24:39.540 --> 00:24:41.180
 They be a band of Banshu monkeys {ts}

00:24:48.090 --> 00:24:49.740
 I deliver unto ye truth {ts}

00:24:51.570 --> 00:24:52.950
Aesthete's Roast.

00:24:53.690 --> 00:24:58.370
Does the fork joining the aesthete and warrior exist?

00:24:56.570 --> 00:24:59.940
 Aesthete's Roast {ts}
